  "translations": {
    "translations": [
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "TW",
        "iso_639_1": "zh",
        "name": "普通话",
        "english_name": "Mandarin",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "最近，誠誠變得很奇怪。他不再主動說要打棒球，也總是躲著球場，像是有什麼地方不對勁。那是他曾經最喜歡的地方，如今卻變成一道無法靠近的界線。媽媽看在眼裡，卻摸不著原因，只能試著用陪伴拉近距離。而那份讓誠誠困惑又害怕的感覺，來自他最信任的大人之一，像紅土一樣黏在身上，怎麼拍也拍不乾淨。他不知道說出來會不會失去什麼，也不確定自己是否有資格討厭那些記憶。直到某天傍晚，他一個人站在球場邊，望著腳邊的球棒。他知道，這一次，他必須決定──要不要揮出自己的那一棒。",
          "runtime": 20,
          "tagline": "如果我說了，還會有人陪我嗎？",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "US",
        "iso_639_1": "en",
        "name": "English",
        "english_name": "English",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "These days, Cheng-Cheng seems different. He doesn’t play baseball anymore and stays away from the field. It feels like he has something he can’t tell anyone. His mom tries to help but doesn’t know why. The fear and confusion come from one of the adults he trusts the most. One evening, Cheng-Cheng stands by the field, holding his bat, wondering—should he swing, or not?",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "The Brave Swing"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "DK",
        "iso_639_1": "da",
        "name": "Dansk",
        "english_name": "Danish",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "For tiden virker Cheng-Cheng ved siden af sig selv. Han har opgivet baseball og holder sig væk fra banen. Det lader til, at der er noget, han ikke tør fortælle sine omgivelser. En aften står Cheng-Cheng med battet i hånden og overvejer: Skal han svinge eller ej?",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "The Brave Swing"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
